INCIDENT REPORT - File #{CODE}
Location: Planning Department, City Hall, 3rd Floor

On {DATE} at 11:45 AM, {P1} reported a malfunctioning printer in the common workspace. {P2} from IT Support responded within 20 minutes and identified a paper jam. {P3} assisted in relocating files to a backup machine. {P4} documented the downtime for maintenance records. The incident was resolved by 12:10 PM. All affected department staff were notified of the resolution. No data loss occurred. Preventive maintenance was scheduled for all office equipment by {P1} for the following week to avoid future disruptions. Additional network monitoring was requested to identify any underlying system issues that may have caused the malfunction.

